b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f1293518f2a04ec73ce0117bdc067c4b.poster.avif?t=1755445725\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f1293518f2a04ec73ce0117bdc067c4b.webm?t=1755445725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f1293518f2a04ec73ce0117bdc067c4b.mp4?t=1755445725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/0d5c0b96afe9d82b3db1b2713e2b40c3.avif?t=1755445725\" width=1180 height=352 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Spellcast your way to godhood in this lore-rich 4X strategy game filled with unique species. Evolve your units and lead them into battle, build magnificent cities, and master arcane spellcraft to reshape, or destroy the world itself.",
